(7724778, 1271871, 122678, '<td valign="top">I love the coloration here and the grain works well, very nice image. 7</td>', 'I love the coloration here and the grain works well, very nice image. 7', '2022-08-03 08:45:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7724779, 1271873, 122678, '<td valign="top">I love that this image has slightly different point of view. A stunning use of water droplets and color, a very special image. I also love how the DOF works here leaving each side in focus but not the middle guiding your eye around the entire image.</td>', 'I love that this image has slightly different point of view. A stunning use of water droplets and color, a very special image. I also love how the DOF works here leaving each side in focus but not the middle guiding your eye around the entire image.', '2022-08-03 08:50:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(7724780, 1271839, 122678, '<td valign="top">Nice image, very clear and colorful. I haven''t seen your work lately, glad to see you back.</td>', 'Nice image, very clear and colorful. I haven''t seen your work lately, glad to see you back.', '2022-08-03 08:51:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(7724781, 1271847, 122678, '<td valign="top">Very Beautiful image.</td>', 'Very Beautiful image.', '2022-08-03 08:54:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(7724782, 1271829, 122678, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful compelling image. The colors are splendid here with bright green and blueish fog against the more natural colors of the birds. They are definitely on alert. A terrific image!</td>', 'This is a wonderful compelling image. The colors are splendid here with bright green and blueish fog against the more natural colors of the birds. They are definitely on alert. A terrific image!', '2022-08-03 08:58:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(7724783, 1271846, 122678, '<td valign="top">A nice pop of color and a beautiful way to present it.</td>', 'A nice pop of color and a beautiful way to present it.', '2022-08-03 08:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7724784, 1271862, 122678, '<td valign="top">I like how you presented wet here. Windows are exactly how we determine how hard it is raining.</td>', 'I like how you presented wet here. Windows are exactly how we determine how hard it is raining.', '2022-08-03 09:01:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(7724786, 1271848, 101668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ThingFish:</b></div><hr/><i> Dis pragtig en ek het sommer dadelik geweet dis jy. Ek herken jou styl en die omgewing natuurlik dadelik. Dis mos Ficksburg se stasie daardie :) <br/>Weet jy ne die stasie hier naby ons op Heidelberg lyk amper dieselfde kompleet met die graan silo''s , die ou railway shed en die berge in die agtergrond. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Die verwaarlosing van die stasies in die binneland is vir my net te erg. Hierdie is Fouriesburg stasie en ek het in 1975 met ''n 6 maande oue baba van hier met die trein na Bloemfontein gereis. Nou word die spore nie meer gebruik nie. Ek weet nie eers of die graan van die silo af per trein vervoer word nie. Ek dink nie so nie. Die vermorsing breek my hart.</td>', 'Originally posted by ThingFish: Dis pragtig en ek het sommer dadelik geweet dis jy. Ek herken jou styl en die omgewing natuurlik dadelik. Dis mos Ficksburg se stasie daardie :) Weet jy ne die stasie hier naby ons op Heidelberg lyk amper dieselfde kompleet met die graan silo''s , die ou railway shed en die berge in die agtergrond.   Die verwaarlosing van die stasies in die binneland is vir my net te erg. Hierdie is Fouriesburg stasie en ek het in 1975 met ''n 6 maande oue baba van hier met die trein na Bloemfontein gereis. Nou word die spore nie meer gebruik nie. Ek weet nie eers of die graan van die silo af per trein vervoer word nie. Ek dink nie so nie. Die vermorsing breek my hart.', '2022-08-03 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 0),
